{"version":1,"content":"<p>創辦25年的「北京酷兒影展」（愛酷電影周）昨天（29 日）深夜發聲明，宣布取消原定今起舉辦的第十九屆影展。</p><p>同日，武漢獨立影展「武漢柏林電影周」亦宣布活動延期及安排退票。</p><p>兩影展均未說明取消原因，主辦方至發稿前未回覆本報查詢。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:32.078723+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:59:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:42.391168+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:19:38.391553+00:00","content_hash":"e3848d24bbf52052eb79023528f8bb894e38007f753d520fe6cdb32e56412468","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}